			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 8pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The dollar amount in this column represents the grant date fair value of the RSUs granted to our non-employee directors during 2025, as computed in accordance with ASC 718, not including any estimates of forfeitures. For a discussion of valuation assumptions, see Note 1 to our consolidated financial statements included in our 2025 Annual Report. This amount does not correspond to the actual economic value that may be received from the RSUs. As of December 31, 2025, our non-employee directors had the following outstanding unvested RSUs: Mr. Adams &#8211;&#160;4,267; Ms. Bozilenko &#8211;&#160;4,267; Ms. Broadfoot &#8211;&#160;4,267; Dr. Hoffman &#8211;&#160;4,267; Mr. Jain &#8211;&#160;4,848; Mr. Todisco &#8211;&#160;6,397; and Mr. Wan &#8211;&#160;4,267.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

