			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 8pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The dollar amounts in this column represent the aggregate grant date fair value of the RSUs granted during the year, as computed in accordance with ASC 718, not including any estimates of forfeitures. For a discussion of valuation assumptions, see Notes 1 and 10 to our consolidated financial statements included in our 2025 Annual Report. These amounts do not necessarily correspond to the actual economic value that may be received by the named executive officers.</p>
