			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 8pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The dollar amounts in this column represent the aggregate grant date fair value of all option awards granted during the indicated year. These amounts have been calculated in accordance with ASC 718, using the Black-Scholes option-pricing model and excluding the effect of estimated forfeitures. For a discussion of valuation assumptions, see Notes 1 and 10 to our consolidated financial statements included in our 2025 Annual Report. These amounts do not necessarily correspond to the actual value that may be recognized from the option awards by the named executive officers.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

