<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Shakil Aslam, M.D.</i></b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:18pt;">In May 2024, we entered into an offer letter agreement with Dr. Aslam, which provided for an initial annual base salary of $455,000 with an annual cash bonus targeted at 40% of Dr. Aslam&#8217;s base salary. As of the date of this proxy statement, Dr. Aslam&#8217;s annual base salary is $492,128 and Dr. Aslam is eligible for an annual target bonus of up to 40% of his annual base salary.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

