<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 18pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 8pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(4)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 8pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The dollar amounts reported in column (d) represent the average of the amounts reported for our NEOs as a group (excluding Mr. Angotti, who has served as our CEO since 2017) in the &#8220;Total&#8221;&#160;column of the Summary Compensation Table in each applicable year. Mr. Asadorian and Dr. Aslam were our NEOs (excluding Mr. Angotti) included for the purpose of calculating the average amounts in 2025. Messrs. Asadorian and Dasu were our NEOs (excluding Mr. Angotti) included for the purpose of calculating the average amounts in 2024. Mr. Asadorian and Dr. Palmer were our NEOs (excluding Mr. Angotti) included for the purpose of calculating the average amounts in 2023.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

