			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 8pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Consists of 2,730,718 shares of common stock for which Laurence W. Lytton and the Lytton-Kambara Foundation have shared voting and dispositive power. The address of Laurence W. Lytton and the Lytton-Kambara Foundation is 467 Central Park West, New York, NY 10025.Information regarding Lytton-Kambara Foundation is based solely upon Schedule 13G/A filed with the SEC on February 17, 2026 by Lytton-Kambara Foundation.</p>
